name 'designing-reliable-apps-preassessment-q4_2026'

question 'You open a rideshare app in Airplane Mode. The buttons and menu appear immediately, but the list of nearby drivers never loads. What does this best illustrate?'

wrong 'The app has a bug that prevents it from showing all its content at the same time'
wrong 'The server received the request but rejected it with an error code'
right 'The buttons and menus are static content built into the app, while the driver list is dynamic content fetched from a live server'
wrong 'The app successfully loaded all its content from a local cache on the device'

allow_multiple_attempts true

